      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blow ye the trumpet in Zion, and sound an alarm in my holy mountain: let all the inhabitants of the land tremble: for the day of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh, for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nigh at hand;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A day of darkness and of gloominess, a day of clouds and of thick darkness, as the morning spread upon the mountains: a great people and a strong; there hath not been ever the like, neither shall be any more after it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the years of many generations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A fire devoureth before them; and behind them a flame burneth: the land",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the garden of Eden before them, and behind them a desolate wilderness; yea, and nothing shall escape them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The appearance of them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the appearance of horses; and as horsemen, so shall they run.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like the noise of chariots on the tops of mountains shall they leap, like the noise of a flame of fire that devoureth the stubble, as a strong people set in battle array.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before their face the people shall be much pained: all faces shall gather blackness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall run like mighty men; they shall climb the wall like men of war; and they shall march every one on his ways, and they shall not break their ranks:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither shall one thrust another; they shall walk every one in his path: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they fall upon the sword, they shall not be wounded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall run to and fro in the city; they shall run upon the wall, they shall climb up upon the houses; they shall enter in at the windows like a thief.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The earth shall quake before them; the heavens shall tremble: the sun and the moon shall be dark, and the stars shall withdraw their shining:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall utter his voice before his army: for his camp",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "very great: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strong that executeth his word: for the day of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great and very terrible; and who can abide it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
