          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore also now, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", turn ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to me with all your heart, and with fasting, and with weeping, and with mourning:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And rend your heart, and not your garments, and turn unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God: for he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gracious and merciful, slow to anger, and of great kindness, and repenteth him of the evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who knoweth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he will return and repent, and leave a blessing behind him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a meat offering and a drink offering unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Blow the trumpet in Zion, sanctify a fast, call a solemn assembly:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gather the people, sanctify the congregation, assemble the elders, gather the children, and those that suck the breasts: let the bridegroom go forth of his chamber, and the bride out of her closet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let the priests, the ministers of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.2.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.2.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
